OL,3,GNEWSAHealey announces #100 energy
OL,4,Apayment for 20 million households as he
OL,5,Adelivers Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey announces 20
OL,8,Fmillion households in council tax bands
OL,9,FA-D in England will receive a #100
OL,10,F"household energy payment" in his first
OL,11,FBudget - watch live above
OL,13,FFunding will be allocated to devolved
OL,14,Fgovernments in Scotland, Wales and
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland to do the same
OL,17,FTory leader Kemi Badenoch is currently
OL,18,Fresponding, saying next year the UK's
OL,19,Ftax burden will be "the highest in our
OL,20,Fcountry's history"
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
