OL,3,GNEWSAHealey announces #100 energy
OL,4,Apayment for 20 million households as he
OL,5,Adelivers Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealey says there will be "fiscal
OL,8,Fdevolution", with business rates
OL,9,Fretained locally by the end of the
OL,10,Fdecade and mayors getting a share of
OL,11,Fincome tax from 2028
OL,13,FA smaller rise in minimum wage for
OL,14,Fyoung workers is confirmed, with those
OL,15,Faged 18 to 20 seeing it go up by 3.9%
OL,17,FBanks will pay an extra 3% on the banks
OL,18,Fsurcharge, which will be
OL,19,F"time-limited", Healey says - a smaller
OL,20,Ftax rise than expected
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
