OL,3,GNEWSAHealey announces #100 energy
OL,4,Apayment for 20 million households as he
OL,5,Adelivers Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere's a mixed outlook on the economy
OL,8,Ffrom the public finances watchdog -
OL,9,Fwith GDP expected to expand by 1.2%
OL,10,Fthis year, but next year it forecasts
OL,11,F1%, a sharp drop from earlier
OL,12,Fexpectations - see the numbers in
OL,13,Fcharts
